1.21.2: quiet build and tests on macOS

The _DARWIN_C_SOURCE defines in parallel.c and serve.c are guarded so
the Makefile's -D_DARWIN_C_SOURCE no longer redefines them; the serve
test waits on the server it kills so bash stops reporting the kill;
the fake-DOM page test supplies its own localStorage so node 22+ does
not warn about its experimental one. No change to rendering.

